OL,3,GNEWSAWolves themed garden shed pub wins
OL,4,Atop accolade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wolverhampton Wanderers themed shed
OL,7,Fhas been crowned the 2026 Pub Shed of
OL,8,Fthe Year.
OL,10,FTina Hibbs' winning wooden sanctuary,
OL,11,Fnamed Bar Hibby's, started as a place
OL,12,Fto store her husband's "vast collection
OL,13,Fof wolves memorabilia" but soon became
OL,14,Fa family hub with a pub thrown in.
OL,16,F"It gets used every weekend," she said
OL,17,Fof the base in Rugeley, Staffordshire.
OL,18,F"We always have big parties for the
OL,19,Fkids, we have an Easter egg hunt, and
OL,20,Fdecorate it [at] Halloween. It's a big
OL,21,Fpart of the family."
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
